{"last_link_id": 23, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 姿势图库 → Qwen 姿态编辑\n\n请拖入本文件。画布里的 Union Lineart 会把人偶线稿画进成图。\n\n1. 姿势图库的线稿接 Text Encode 的 image 1。\n2. 真人照片接 image 2。上次测试的头像已填在「真人参考图」，可以换成自己的照片。不要对调这两张图。\n3. 底模用 Qwen Image 2.1（qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot），CLIP 用 Qwen3-VL，VAE 用 qwen_image_2.1_vae。\n4. 采样保持 25 步、CFG 1、Euler / simple、denoise 1。CFG 不要改成 8。\n\nShaun Yang for RH"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "用法", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [980, 250], "pos": [28.506354808099562, -89.65545986059706], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## 姿势图库 → Qwen 姿态编辑\n\n请拖入本文件。画布里的 Union Lineart 会把人偶线稿画进成图。\n\n1. 姿势图库的线稿接 Text Encode 的 image 1。\n2. 真人照片接 image 2。上次测试的头像已填在「真人参考图」，可以换成自己的照片。不要对调这两张图。\n3. 底模用 Qwen Image 2.1（qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot），CLIP 用 Qwen3-VL，VAE 用 qwen_image_2.1_vae。\n4. 采样保持 25 步、CFG 1、Euler / simple、denoise 1。CFG 不要改成 8。\n\nShaun Yang for RH"}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "姿势图", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1, 14], "label": "姿势图", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "姿势图"}, {"name": "宽度", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "宽度", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"name": "高度", "slot_index": 2, "links": [], "label": "高度", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"name": "姿势ID", "slot_index": 3, "links": [], "label": "姿势ID", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "姿势ID"}, {"name": "描述", "slot_index": 4, "links": [], "label": "描述", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "描述"}], "widgets_values": ["upper80v2_P014_front", "原尺寸", 768, 1024, false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "pose_id"}, "name": "pose_id", "label": "pose_id", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "pose_id"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_mode"}, "name": "resize_mode", "label": "resize_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resize_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "loc